  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "ctfkit",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/compliancetf/ctfkit",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "ctf.policy.disabled_control_unknown",
              "name": "policy.disabled_control_unknown",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A compliance.tf module source disables a token the control catalog does not hold"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A compliance.tf module source disables a token the control catalog does not hold"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "A compliance.tf module source disables a token the control catalog does not hold. When the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes. Documentation: https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#disabled-controls",
                "markdown": "**A compliance.tf module source disables a token the control catalog does not hold.**\n\n### When the finding is intended\n\nWhen the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes.\n\n```yaml\nexceptions:\n  - rule: ctf.policy.disabled_control_unknown\n    resource: <address in the finding>\n    justification: <why>\n    approved_by: <approver>\n    review_date: \"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n```\n\n[ctfkit by compliance.tf: rule reference](https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#disabled-controls)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#disabled-controls",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "compliance",
                  "terraform",
                  "policy"
                ],
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "ctf.policy.disabled_control_unknown",
          "level": "error",
          "kind": "fail",
          "message": {
            "text": "Module source disables s3_bucket_versioning_enabled, which is not a control id in catalog 2026.11.1; it is a typo, or a control outside this catalog (the embedded catalog holds the CIS v6.0 controls only; name a full catalog with --catalog)"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "main.tf"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 1,
                  "endLine": 45
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "module.s3_bucket",
                  "kind": "module"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
